{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"X\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"big\": \"X\",\n    \"small\": \"Y\",\n    \"core\": \"X\",\n    \"concise\": \"X\",\n    \"human\": \"X\",\n    \"fine\": \"X\",\n    \"load\": \"X\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"big：X的高亮短语能直接串起离开、想念、受过的委屈、孤单、犹豫和继续往前；Y的大块虽然信息完整，但反复围绕抽象的“分寸”和“自持”，具体处境不够突出。small：Y的感受和旁注与对应段落结合得比较紧，补充层次也较清楚；X有些斜线并列的意象容易互相争夺注意力。core：X完整呈现了维护尊严与怀念旧日生活、归属感之间的反复拉扯，也交代了最后不再责怪自己、带着想念继续生活的落点。concise：Y多次重复“守住分寸”“把心思收回来”等意思，部分屏内和跨屏表达缺少新信息；X虽然内容丰富，但大部分重复都带来了新的处境或思考。human：Y有“自然觉得属于其中的自在”“不甘心就此松开自持”“自然归属感”等生硬、书面化或标签式表达；X整体更符合日常说话习惯，人物心理也更容易理解。fine：X留下了“不是记忆变坏了，是它太好了”“把衣服理整齐，再抬起头”“心里只哼自己的旧歌”等具体、有辨识度的体验；Y相对更多使用温暖、疲惫、惊惧、珍惜等概括性表达。load：X的大字主要是较短的自然意群，扫读负担较小；Y每条话都是大字，尤其S03的五块和S12的四块，在38秒和25秒的停留时间内都比较吃力。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "8aee00e9-037c-47b6-957e-8818b4bfdb45", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261111T091858400123Z", "elapsed_seconds": 262.312, "completed_utc": "2026-11-11T09:23:20.711177+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "1916acd60d2ecc895d15f24d6d58369215424550754b58b4d8ad73f4cb38a387", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applic